/T ( Senza Confini is a Social Promotion Association founded in 2020 in La Spezia with the mission to inspire and empower young people to take an active role in shaping their communities and society at large. Operating at both local and European levels, the organization focuses on fostering active citizenship among youth, addressing key challenges such as climate change, gender equality, democracy, and social inclusion. Our work is rooted in the belief that young people are the driving force of positive change. Through innovative projects, educational initiatives, and community engagement, Senza Confini supports youth in becoming active participants in their social, cultural, and political environments, while fostering connections across borders to build a stronger, more inclusive Europe.)
/E ( Senza Confini is a Social Promotion Association founded in 2020 in La Spezia with the mission to inspire and empower young people to take an active role in shaping their communities and society at large. Operating at both local and European levels, the organization focuses on fostering active citizenship among youth, addressing key challenges such as climate change, gender equality, democracy, and social inclusion. Our work is rooted in the belief that young people are the driving force of positive change. Through innovative projects, educational initiatives, and community engagement, Senza Confini supports youth in becoming active participants in their social, cultural, and political environments, while fostering connections across borders to build a stronger, more inclusive Europe.)
